  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: denial of service in the optional imptcp module: a regex match at offset zero after oversize-frame recovery submits a negative message length and crashes rsyslogd\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-19654.patch: denial of service in the optional imptcp module: a regex match at offset zero after oversize-frame recovery submits a negative message length and crashes rsyslogd\n     - CVE-2026-19654\n   * debian/patches/Skip-tests-that-cannot-run-in-the-build-environment.patch:\n     skip omfile-read-only, omfile-read-only-errmsg, privdropuser and\n     privdropuserid. All four fail in the pdebuild chroot for reasons\n     unrelated to rsyslog (root bypasses the 0400 mode the first two rely\n     on; the chroot has no unprivileged test user for the last two), and\n     they fail identically on the unpatched vendor sources.",
